<title>JAPAN: BOJ's Matsushita to appear in parliament Thursday.</title>
<headline>BOJ's Matsushita to appear in parliament Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan Governor Yasuo Matsushita will appear before a settlement panel of the Upper House of parliament at about 2 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Thursday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The BOJ gave no other details.</p>
